---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Capabilities" description="GoreeWorks capabilities span product design, software, web development, commerce systems, publishing, and creative media.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="site-shell">
      <span class="kicker">Capabilities</span>
      <h1 class="mo-type-display mo-type-balanced">Design. Build. Deliver.</h1>
      <p class="mo-type-body mo-type-pretty">The GoreeWorks skill set grew from design and digital products into web development, software, applications, infrastructure, automation, commerce, and product systems.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule">
    <div class="site-shell grid-2">
      <div><span class="kicker">Product + design</span><h2 class="mo-type-large-title mo-type-balanced">Thoughtful from the beginning.</h2></div>
      <div class="prose"><p>Product thinking, interface design, visual systems, and user experiences that connect the idea to the finished result.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-rule">
    <div class="site-shell grid-2">
      <div><span class="kicker">Software + web</span><h2 class="mo-type-large-title mo-type-balanced">Useful systems, built to last.</h2></div>
      <div class="prose"><p>Websites, applications, automation, self-hosted systems, and internal tools developed around ownership, control, and practical use.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-rule">
    <div class="site-shell grid-2">
      <div><span class="kicker">Commerce + operations</span><h2 class="mo-type-large-title mo-type-balanced">Connect the product to the customer.</h2></div>
      <div class="prose"><p>Ecommerce, customer systems, product workflows, and online business operations brought together as one connected experience.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-rule">
    <div class="site-shell grid-2">
      <div><span class="kicker">Publishing + media</span><h2 class="mo-type-large-title mo-type-balanced">Ideas in more than one format.</h2></div>
      <div class="prose"><p>Publishing resources and creative media that extend products, knowledge, and experiences into new forms.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
